title    Chalk Up
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Climbing Gym (level6) option (#456): a supersaw hook in D major at 174 that stops on the last beat of its bar for two 909 claps, chalk-slapped hands, over a pumping FM bass and offbeat synth-brass stabs. The last eight bars lift a tone, to E major. Layers: hook, claps, bass and stabs from the start, then bigkick, gated snare and hats at 2x, a xylophone an octave over the hook at 3x, sixteenth hats and an orchestra hit on every bar at FRENZY.
tempo    174
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.22

# untagged voices are the base layer, the hook among them (layers only add); the intro plays every layer
voice lead   supersaw  vol=0.92
voice slap   clap909   vol=0.71 pan=0.15
voice stab   synbrass  vol=0.41 pan=-0.3 center=F#4 gate=0.5
voice bass   fmbass    vol=0.57  gate=0.6
voice rise   riser     vol=0.32
voice kick   bigkick   vol=0.53 layer=drums
voice snare  gatesnare vol=0.57  pan=0.05 layer=drums
voice hat    hat909    vol=0.32 pan=0.35 layer=drums
voice crash  crash     vol=0.32 pan=-0.2 layer=drums
voice xylo   xylophone vol=0.39 pan=0.3 oct=1 layer=lead
voice fhat   hat909    vol=0.25 pan=-0.35 layer=frenzy
voice hit    orchhit   vol=0.37 layer=frenzy

pattern intro
slap  | X.X. .... X.X. .... | X.X. X.X. XXXX XXXX |
hit   | [D]!--- .--- [D]!--- .--- | [A]!--- [A]!--- [A]!------- |
rise  | _ | A5--------------- |
bass  | D2--- .--- D2--- .--- | A2--- A2--- A2------- |
kick  | X... .... X... .... | X... X... X.X. XXXX |

pattern A
lead  | D5- F#5- A5- A5 B5 A5- F#5- .--- | B4- D5- F#5- F#5 G5 F#5- D5- .--- | G5- F#5- E5- D5- E5- F#5- G5- A5- | A5------- E5- F#5- E5- C#5- |
xylo  | D5- F#5- A5- A5 B5 A5- F#5- .--- | B4- D5- F#5- F#5 G5 F#5- D5- .--- | G5- F#5- E5- D5- E5- F#5- G5- A5- | A5------- E5- F#5- E5- C#5- |
slap  | .... .... .... X.X. | % | _ | _ |
stab  | .- [D]- .- [D]- .- [D]- .- [D]- | .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- | .- [G]- .- [G]- .- [G]- .- [G]- | .- [A]- .- [A]- .- [A]- .- [A]- |
bass  | D2- D2- D3- D2- .- D2- D3- D2- | B2- B2- B3- B2- .- B2- B3- B2- | G2- G2- G3- G2- .- G2- G3- G2- | A2- A2- A3- A2- .- A2- A3- A2- |
kick  | x... x... x... x... | % | % | x... x... x... x.xx |
snare | .... X... .... X... | % | % | .... X... ..x. XxXX |
hat   | ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x. | % | % | % |
crash | X... .... .... .... | _ | _ | _ |
fhat  | xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx | % | % | % |
hit   | [D]!--- .----------- | [Bm]!--- .----------- | [G]!--- .----------- | [A]!--- .----------- |

pattern A2 from A
lead  | D5- F#5- A5- A5 B5 A5- F#5- .--- | B4- D5- F#5- F#5 G5 F#5- D5- .--- | G5- F#5- E5- D5- E5- F#5- G5- A5- | A5- G5- F#5- E5- F#5- G5- A5- C#6- |
xylo  | D5- F#5- A5- A5 B5 A5- F#5- .--- | B4- D5- F#5- F#5 G5 F#5- D5- .--- | G5- F#5- E5- D5- E5- F#5- G5- A5- | A5- G5- F#5- E5- F#5- G5- A5- C#6- |
crash | _ | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B from A
lead  | B5- A5- F#5- D5- .- F#5- A5- B5- | D6--- B5- A5- G5--- .--- | A5- F#5- D5- F#5- A5- D6- B5- A5- | D6------- A5- F#5- .--- |
xylo  | B5- A5- F#5- D5- .- F#5- A5- B5- | D6--- B5- A5- G5--- .--- | A5- F#5- D5- F#5- A5- D6- B5- A5- | D6------- A5- F#5- .--- |
slap  | .... .... X... .... | .... .... .... X.X. | _ | .... .... .... X.X. |
stab  | .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- | .- [G]- .- [G]- .- [G]- .- [G]- | .- [D]- .- [D]- .- [D]- .- [D]- | .- [D]- .- [D]- .- [D]- .- [D]- |
bass  | B2- B2- B3- B2- .- B2- B3- B2- | G2- G2- G3- G2- .- G2- G3- G2- | D2- D2- D3- D2- .- D2- D3- D2- | D2- D2- D3- D2- .- D2- D3- D2- |
hit   | [Bm]!--- .----------- | [G]!--- .----------- | [D]!--- .----------- | [D]!--- .----------- |
crash | X... .... .... .... | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B2 from B
lead  | B5- A5- F#5- D5- .- F#5- A5- B5- | D6--- B5- A5- G5--- .--- | G5- E5- B4- E5- G5- B5- A5- G5- | A5----- C#6- E6- C#6 A5 .--- |
xylo  | B5- A5- F#5- D5- .- F#5- A5- B5- | D6--- B5- A5- G5--- .--- | G5- E5- B4- E5- G5- B5- A5- G5- | A5----- C#6- E6- C#6 A5 .--- |
slap  | .... .... X... .... | .... .... .... X.X. | _ | .... .... .... XXXX |
stab  | .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- .- [Bm]- | .- [G]- .- [G]- .- [G]- .- [G]- | .- [Em]- .- [Em]- .- [Em]- .- [Em]- | .- [A7]- .- [A7]- .- [A7]- .- [A7]- |
bass  | B2- B2- B3- B2- .- B2- B3- B2- | G2- G2- G3- G2- .- G2- G3- G2- | E2- E2- E3- E2- .- E2- E3- E2- | A2- A2- A3- A2- .- A2- A3- A2- |
hit   | [Bm]!--- .----------- | [G]!--- .----------- | [Em]!--- .----------- | [A7]!--- .----------- |
snare | .... X... .... X... | % | % | ..x. x.x. xxxx XXXX |

play intro
loop A A2 B B2 A A2 A+2 A2+2
